## Authority Boundary Conclusion

The walkthrough accurately explains that this is a small pre-Architect candidate advisory review stage. It can label AVF-ranked memory candidates as advisory accept/degrade/reject/needs-review, but it cannot decide truth, cannot command Architect, cannot create FinalOutput, cannot move canonical GTValidator upstream, and cannot override Root. Root remains final authority.

